# LF in the repository AND in the worktree, on every platform, as in kama, kyoten and the peer games. Without it a
# Windows checkout obeys `core.autocrlf` and lands every text file as CRLF, which breaks wherever bytes are compared
# rather than executed: tools/check-bindings.sh compares src/native/webgpu.gen.kama byte for byte with what the
# generator writes. Binary files are left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
